        "name": "Pale Cascade",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Diana creates three orbiting spheres that detonate on contact with enemies to deal damage in an area. She also gains a temporary shield that absorbs damage. If her third sphere detonates, the shield gains additional strength.",
        "bodyHtml": "Diana creates three orbiting spheres for 5 seconds that explode on contact, each dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(20/32/44/56/68 + ([[si:scaleap]]18% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>, up to a max of <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(60/96/132/168/204 + (54% Ability Power)) damage</span>.<br /><br />Diana also gains <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(45/60/75/90/105 + ([[si:scaleap]]30% Ability Power) + ([[si:scalehealth]]11% bonus Health)) Shield</span> for the same duration. When the last sphere detonates, she gains an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(45/60/75/90/105 + ([[si:scaleap]]30% Ability Power) + ([[si:scalehealth]]11% bonus Health)) Shield</span> and refreshes the duration.",
