        "bodyHtml": "Diana <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Pulls In</span>, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> by 40/50/60%, and reveals nearby enemies for 2 seconds.<br /><br />If Diana hits at least one enemy champion, she calls to the moon, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(200/300/400 + ([[si:scaleap]]60% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> plus <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(35/60/85 + ([[si:scaleap]]15% Ability Power))</span> for each champion pulled beyond the first, up to a max of an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(175/300/425 + (75% Ability Power)) damage</span>.",
